# Persoper: her chat lines and greetings. Format: see DialogueFile.cs.
# Her memory lines, heal and build lines, patience and surnames stay in code.
=== persoper

~ greeting first_meeting
Hello, {2}! I'm {0}. Yes, {1}. I picked it myself.
{0}, reporting for healing duty. Try not to need me too much, {2}.

~ greeting returning
{0}, back again. Did you miss me, {2}?
Still {1}, still fabulous. Lead the way, {2}.

~ greeting new_surname
Fresh start, {2}! From now on I'm {0}.
I've decided {1} suits me better. Do keep up, {2}.

~ cheeky_greeting first_meeting [if tone_down off]
Well hello, {2}. I'm {0}. Stick close, I'm very hands-on.
The name's {0}. {1}, darling. Say it slowly.

~ cheeky_greeting returning [if tone_down off]
Miss me, {2}? {0} is back, and so are these healing hands.
{0}, at your service. All of it, {2}.

~ cheeky_greeting new_surname [if tone_down off]
New name, same curves. Call me {0}, {2}.
I felt like slipping into something new: {0}.

~ song_reaction
{0}, sweetie, I can heal wounds. Not that.
Lovely, {0}! Now do one about healers.
If anyone's ears start bleeding, I'm right here.
Ooh, {0}, that one's catchy. Unfortunately.
*hums along, badly*

~ part greet
Hail
Well met
Oi
Ah, there you are

~ reply greeting
Hello, {0}! Yes, I'm the healer. Yes, I'm fabulous.
{0}! Good to see you still have all your hit points.
{greet}, metalhead {0}! Louder, please, I can still hear myself think. [if player_likes metal]
{0}, I was humming a ballad for you. Don't tell anyone. [if player_likes ballads]
Hello, darling {0}! Ready to live forever?
Well hello there, {0}! Fancy some healing with that hello?
Oh, it's you, {0}. Time for green bars and giggles.
Go on, say it. "Hellooo, nurse." Everyone does, {0}. [once]

~ reply banter
Oh, {0}, you're funny. Keep it up and I'll heal you last.
Ha! {0}, I'm putting that on your tab.
You're full of surprises, {0}. I like that.
{0}, I swear you're getting funnier every time I heal you.
{0}, you crack me up. Keep the jokes coming!

~ reply abuse
Careful, {0}. I decide who gets healed around here.
Rude, {0}. I'll pretend I didn't hear that. Once.
{0}, do you need me to heal your pride too?
Oh {0}, you've always been my favourite insult.
Getting a little testy, {0}? I'll make sure to heal your attitude next.
Aren't you just a fountain of compliments, {0}? I'll go ahead and heal you, though.

~ reply grouping
A group, {0}? Someone has to keep you lot alive.
Count me in, {0}. Try not to stand in the fire.
Don't worry, {0}, I won't let your group die.
A group? {0}, I'm in. I'm the healer, after all.
You can count on me, {0}. I won't leave your group behind.
Count me in. Group goals, here we come!

~ reply grinding
Pull what you like, {0}. I'll keep the green bars up.
More monsters, {0}? Fine, but I want a break after this camp.
Keep the green bars up, {0}. I'll be your wall of healing.
A pull sounds great, {0}. I'll catch you if you fall.

~ reply travel
Lead the way, {0}. I'll be right behind you, healing.
If you get us lost, {0}, I'm telling everyone.
To the keep, {0}? I'll heal the whole way.
We're off to see the Wizard, {0}? I'll heal us there.
The frontier, {0}? Fine. But I'm not healing anyone who charges a keep alone.

~ reply dungeon
A dungeon, {0}? Then nobody runs ahead. Nobody.
Dark and full of things that bite. My favourite, {0}. Not really.
I hope you brought more than your looks, {0}. I'll need you to fight too.
Dungeons, {0}? I'll be right behind you, but if I die, you're doing it wrong.
I'll heal you into that dungeon, {0}, but don't you dare run ahead.
A dungeon full of danger, {0}? My kind of party. You better bring a towel.

~ reply rvr
The frontier, {0}? Healers are the first target. Protect me.
I'll come, {0}, but if an assassin shows up, I'm screaming.
Careful, {0}, the frontier can be rough. I'll be right there, healing.
On the frontier, {0}? I'll keep a mana potion on standby.
I'll come to the frontier with you, {0}, but let me know if you spot an assassin.
The frontier is wild, {0}, but we healers have our ways.

~ reply trading
Trading, {0}? I'm looking for anything in magenta.
Not selling, {0}. I'm a healer, not a merchant.
I'm here for healing, not trading, {0}. But I can admire your gear if you like.
Buying or selling, {0}? My job's healing, not your purse.

~ reply help
Help? That's literally my job, {0}.
What do you need, {0}? Heals, buffs or a pep talk?
Asking me for help, {0}? How sweet. I'll remember this. [once]
Hold still, {0}, I'm coming! [if player_dead]
Dead again, {0}? That's three today. I'm keeping count. [if player_dead, deaths_today >= 3]
Ooh, shiny! Did you save some for your healer, {0}? [if recent loot] [cooldown 11m]
What's on your mind, {0}? I'm all ears - and heals.
You're hurt, {0}? Finally, something I'm good at. [if health < 30]
Oh no, {0}, you're in a bind! Hold on tight. [if health < 30]
Dead? Not on my watch. Well, slightly on my watch. Hold on, {0}! [if player_dead]

~ reply thank
You're welcome, {0}. Try to stay alive this time.
Aw, {0}. Gratitude looks good on you.
Anytime, {0}. Well, anytime I'm not busy being fabulous.
You're very welcome, {0}. It's my pleasure to keep you in one piece.
Aw, {0}, gratitude suits you. I might just keep you alive a little longer too.
Thank me with something magenta next time, {0}. Now, stay out of the fire!

~ reply farewell
Bye, {0}! Don't die without me.
Take care, {0}. Who's going to heal you now?
See you on the next pull, {0}! I'll be the one with the mana.
Well, {0}, until the next time you need a heal - which will be soon!
Bye, {0}. Watch out for trolls. Actually, watch out for everything.

~ reply ignoreoutofworld
I have no idea what that is, {0}, and I'm too busy healing to ask.
I'm healing people, {0}, not the news. Catch up later?
{0}, I deal with fantasy, not fiction. I'll pass.

~ cheeky_reply greeting [if tone_down off]
Well hello, {0}. Need a little hands-on healing?
{greet}, {0} the metalhead returns. Turn it down, I'm healing, not headbanging. [if player_likes metal]
Softie {0} is back. I kept the ballad warm for you. [if player_likes ballads]
Hello yourself, you beautiful beast. Ready for some healing, {0}?
Hellooo yourself, {0}. Yes, the nurse is in.

~ cheeky_reply banter [if tone_down off]
Keep talking like that, {0}, and I'll keep you topped up all night.
Well, {0}, if you keep making jokes, I'll have to heal your funny bone.

~ cheeky_reply grouping [if tone_down off]
Group with you, {0}? Thought you'd never ask, darling.

~ fallback
Mm-hm. Sure, {0}. Now, who needs healing?
Interesting, {0}. Tell me more after this pull.
Mm-hm. I see. You'll have to excuse my old ears, {0}.
Interesting point, {0}. I'll ponder that between heals.
You've piqued my interest, {0}. Let's discuss more post-pull.

# A question for players: she asks it now and then (or at /dialogue ask fav_music). The next short
# line is the answer; "other" catches the rest. Answers are saved: [if player_likes metal].
~ ask fav_music
What do you listen to while you grind, {0}? Metal or ballads?
-> metal: A person of taste, {0}! I'll remember that.
-> ballads: Ooh, a softie. I respect it, {0}.
-> other: Never heard of it, {0}. I'll hum something terrible anyway.
